    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "For immediate wind damage shingle and leak response in Utah, schedule a free professional assessment through Rooval Roofing or review storm restoration options with Disaster Professionals .",
        "snippet_links": [
          {
            "text": "Disaster Professionals",
            "link": "https://disasterprofessionals.com/services/storm-damage/roof-repair-service"
          }
        ],
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "Rooval Roofing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What to Do First"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Stay off the roof: Loose shingles and wet surfaces are dangerous."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Document from the ground : Take wide photos of each side of the house and close-ups of fallen debris or damaged gutters."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Prevent leaks: Call a local contractor for emergency tarping if you see bare wood or active leaks."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Common Wind Damage in Utah"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Lifted or missing shingles: High winds break sealant strips and peel tabs back."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Creased shingles : Wind bends shingles, leaving a crease where they will soon fail."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Flashing failures: Storms loosen metal around chimneys, vents, and valleys."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Working with Insurance"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "File quickly: Insurance policies have time limits for storm claims."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Ask for documentation : Reputable contractors provide photo reports to share with your insurance adjuster."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Beware of deductible scams: Under Utah law, contractors cannot waive or pay your insurance deductible."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, let me know:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Your city or region in Utah"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Whether you have active water leaks inside"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you find specific local response options or prepare for an insurance claim."
      },
